Complete 64-pixel backward, same widths/modules: 52 finite nonzero parameter-tensor gradients; minimum norm 0.001402558.
SqueezeNet version 10, bypass true: 1248424 learned scalars; all eight 224-pixel Fire shapes and ceil-pool stages verified.
Complete 64-pixel backward, same widths/modules: 52 finite nonzero parameter-tensor gradients; minimum norm 0.015759319.
